{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVの予告編上がってるのですが\nもうチェックしてくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソロ曲だー\nひゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも正直これは\n本編観ないと始まらない的なところあるので\n是非、観てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/03/21/0643527/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/03/21/0643527/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言うことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日17thシングル\n『インフルエンサー』発売日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回ジャケットにいるのです\n通常盤です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上に記述しました個人PVは\nType-Dに収録されてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\n中田推しは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-Dと通常盤を要チェックです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、\n表題曲はどのシングルにも入ってるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-AのインフルエンサーのMVも\nType-BのインフルエンサーのMVも\nType-CのインフルエンサーのMVも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-DのインフルエンサーのMVも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観ましょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ同じなんだけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-Aの人生を考えたくなるも\nType-Bの人生を考えたくなるも\nType-Cの人生を考えたくなるも\nType-Dの人生を考えたくなるも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴きましょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ同じなんだけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全タイプに収録って嬉しいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表題曲MVしかり\n女子校カルテットしかり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の久々の選抜のシングルなので\nみなさんにめっちゃ好きになってもらいたいですー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"}